  "transcript": {
    "callId": "7782934452005",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9737,
            "text": "Good afternoon, appreciate you fitting us in."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 14606,
            "end": 24344,
            "text": "Good morning, appreciate you joining on short notice."
          },
          {
            "start": 24345,
            "end": 58425,
            "text": "Hey there, good to have you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 73031,
            "end": 102243,
            "text": "We are mostly in a good spot, just want to run a few things by you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 116850,
            "end": 121718,
            "text": "Let me know what is top of mind and we will work through it."
          },
          {
            "start": 121719,
            "end": 146062,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 155800,
            "end": 199618,
            "text": "The attendee kiosk has to keep taking people in even if the venue connection goes down, and catch back up automatically the moment it reconnects."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 209356,
            "end": 253174,
            "text": "Our fall symposium runs close to 600 members through the door, and the kiosk froze for nearly half an hour when the hotel's connection went out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 258043,
            "end": 262912,
            "text": "That is really helpful context, thank you for walking me through it."
          },
          {
            "start": 262913,
            "end": 296993,
            "text": "Do you know roughly how long the outage lasted and whether anyone had to be checked in manually on paper in the meantime?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 306730,
            "end": 311599,
            "text": "Close to half an hour, and we lost track of at least a dozen people who we had to look up again afterward."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 321337,
            "end": 350549,
            "text": "Before we wrap up, how has everything else been going on your end?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 355418,
            "end": 399236,
            "text": "Our operations lead moved into a new position internally."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 408974,
            "end": 423580,
            "text": "Sounds like a lot of change, hope the transition goes smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 433317,
            "end": 482005,
            "text": "A few of our staff are still getting up to speed on the system."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 496611,
            "end": 535561,
            "text": "Sounds like a solid onboarding process."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 545298,
            "end": 589117,
            "text": "We have had a bit of turnover on our team this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 598854,
            "end": 613461,
            "text": "Congrats on the internal move, that is great to hear."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 618329,
            "end": 647542,
            "text": "We try to run a refresher training every few months."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 652411,
            "end": 701098,
            "text": "That is great, glad the new staff are getting up to speed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 710835,
            "end": 735179,
            "text": "We promoted someone from within to lead a team."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 749785,
            "end": 783866,
            "text": "Hope the reorg settles in without too much disruption."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 793604,
            "end": 832554,
            "text": "We have a training day scheduled for later this month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 837422,
            "end": 886110,
            "text": "Let us know if a live walkthrough for the board would be helpful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 895847,
            "end": 900716,
            "text": "We restructured a bit after a few departures this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 910453,
            "end": 929928,
            "text": "Good to know, we can point any new folks to our onboarding resources."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 934797,
            "end": 983484,
            "text": "We would like more structured training for our newer staff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 998091,
            "end": 1022434,
            "text": "Happy to help however is useful for the newer staff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1027303,
            "end": 1051647,
            "text": "We are training a new hire on our systems this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1056516,
            "end": 1090597,
            "text": "Hope being short staffed does not last too much longer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1100334,
            "end": 1149021,
            "text": "We just finished onboarding a new batch of volunteers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1163628,
            "end": 1187971,
            "text": "We can send over some materials that might help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1202578,
            "end": 1236659,
            "text": "Our new hire starts full time next week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1251265,
            "end": 1270740,
            "text": "Good to hear you found someone for the new hire."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1280477,
            "end": 1314558,
            "text": "Our training schedule got pushed back a bit this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1319427,
            "end": 1348640,
            "text": "Happy to record something if that would help with training."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1353508,
            "end": 1397327,
            "text": "We just brought on a new coordinator last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1402196,
            "end": 1450883,
            "text": "That is a big shift, let us know if training support would help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1465489,
            "end": 1484964,
            "text": "A couple of staff asked for more hands on training recently."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1494702,
            "end": 1504439,
            "text": "Good on you for prioritizing training even when things are busy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1509308,
            "end": 1523914,
            "text": "We added two people to the team this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1538520,
            "end": 1582339,
            "text": "Appreciate you letting us know, we can adjust support as needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1587208,
            "end": 1611551,
            "text": "Our volunteer coordinator handles most of the training these days."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1621289,
            "end": 1660239,
            "text": "Glad to hear you are investing in training, that usually pays off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1665107,
            "end": 1708926,
            "text": "Our development director left for another organization last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1713795,
            "end": 1747876,
            "text": "Glad to hear reinforcements are coming for the team."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1757613,
            "end": 1806301,
            "text": "We are running a training session for new staff next week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1820907,
            "end": 1869594,
            "text": "We can put together something tailored for remote staff if useful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1874463,
            "end": 1889069,
            "text": "We are down a person on the finance team right now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1893938,
            "end": 1903675,
            "text": "Sounds like a busy stretch for the team, hope it eases up soon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1913413,
            "end": 1932888,
            "text": "We are putting together some internal documentation to help with training."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1942625,
            "end": 1952363,
            "text": "Let us know if the schedule shifts and we can adjust."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1966969,
            "end": 1986444,
            "text": "Thanks for walking through all of this with us today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1991313,
            "end": 2025394,
            "text": "Thanks for walking me through all of that, I will follow up with next steps."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
